        "username": "afgncaap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/afgncaap/{size}/2036_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-08-11T00:09:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, to show some extra fun with Mr. Fixer, I would like to point out that text in Sentinels is read very literally, . &nbsp;So, if you were to get a second power that Mr. Fixer could use (e.g., \"Rod of Anubus\" from the Tomb of Anubis enviroment, \"Cosmic Weapon\" from Captain Cosmic's deck, or the powers from Plauge Rat's \"Filthy Vermin\" side) and then play \"Overdrive\", you would be able to use the non-\"Strike\"&nbsp;<span>power and then use \"Strike\" twice for a total of three powers on that turn.</span></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:23:54.138Z",
