        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Also, to show some extra fun with Mr. Fixer, I would like to point out that text in Sentinels is read very literally, . &nbsp;So, if you were to get a second power that Mr. Fixer could use (e.g., &quot;Rod of Anubus&quot; from the Tomb of Anubis enviroment, &quot;Cosmic Weapon&quot; from Captain Cosmic&#39;s deck, or the powers from Plauge Rat&#39;s &quot;Filthy Vermin&quot; side) and then play &quot;Overdrive&quot;, you would be able to use the non-&quot;Strike&quot;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">power and then use &quot;Strike&quot; twice for a total of three powers on that turn.</span></p>",
