        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>As other&#39;s have said, Mr. Fixer&#39;s player was right, per the official ruling. I see your logic, but personally I would argue that this fits with how it&#39;s worded. Overdrive just says he can use &quot;strike&quot; twice this turn, it doesn&#39;t say that it must be when he could normally use a power. If it said &quot;during his power phase&quot;, then I would agree with your argument.</p><p>If you have any more rules arguments in the future, you can refer to the list of official rules clarifications at&nbsp;http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf. Hope this helps!</p>",
